#: generalpageimpl.cpp:51
msgid ""
"<h1>General Setup</h1>You can configure general display options here. For "
"example whether you want to enable the Ctrl+Alt+Backspace keyboard shortcut for "
"shutting down the display."
msgstr ""
"<h1>Opšte postavke</h1>Ovdje možete podesiti generalne opcije ekrana. Npr. da "
"li želite da omogućite kombinaciju tipki Ctrl+Alt+Backspace koja gasi vašu "
"grafičku okolinu."

#: keyboardpageimpl.cpp:208
msgid ""
"<h1>Select Keyboard Type</h1><p>In this screen you select your keyboard <em>"
"model</em> (in the top window) and the keyboard <em>layout</em> "
"(in the bottom window). The model of the keyboard describes the keyboard "
"hardware. The layout determines things like what character will appear on the "
"screen when you press a key.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<h1>Izaberite vrstu tastature</h1><p>Na ovom ekranu možete izabrati <em>"
"model</em> tastature (na vrhu ekrana) i <em>raspored tipaka</em> "
"(u donjem prozoru). Model tastature opisuje hardware tastature. Raspored tipaka "
"određuje koji znak će se pojaviti na ekranu kada pritisnete neku tipku.</p>"

